# Frontend conventions

- Vite + React (JS) in `client/`; port 5173.
- Tailwind + shadcn (`client/src/components/ui`). API via `axiosInstance` (`withCredentials`, refresh queue). Do not add a second HTTP client.
- Auth cookies only — no Bearer token, no Redux persist.
- Routing: Task Board, Task List, Setting, Report. Settings nested: Profile, Users, Permissions, Locations, Holiday, Notification.
- English UI. Do not copy FREGOPS screens.
